<title>USA: US stocks rise at opening, Nasdaq strong.</title>
<headline>US stocks rise at opening, Nasdaq strong.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened higher on Wednesday, with the technology-weighted Nasdaq Composite Index jumping almost a half percent.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials index rose 11 points to 5,885. The long bond up 4/32 to yield 6.98 percent.</p>
